From: 4TheDoctor <62601652+4TheDoctor@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:18:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(patches): add claudio-header pinned header

Fill the fullscreen layout's empty header slot with a Placed drawing of the
Claudio mod, so its header stays above the transcript, and reserve the rows
the mod draws. Two modules change: the REPL passes the header and its height,
and the layout takes that height from the rest of the screen.

Always on when named in --patches; used by Claudio's own patched copy.
